      "type": "text",
      "x": 82.6796875,
      "y": 924.26171875,
      "width": 1186.7542724609375,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "On-demand-baseline stays full and untouched throughout: spot-burst absorbs the whole event. The buffer's freed capacity is reused in seconds; the pods still\nwaiting get scheduled once Karpenter's new node is Ready; that same node ends up hosting the refilled buffer, restoring the safety net for the next spike.",
