      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1369.125,
      "width": 1161.783203125,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Replicas, and the nodes behind them, are pre-warmed well before T0. When the sale actually starts, traffic lands on capacity that already exists: no eviction, no\nnode still provisioning, no scramble.",
